# Copy this file to .env.local, then fill in your real key.
# Get a FREE key (no credit card needed) at https://aistudio.google.com/apikey
# This can be the SAME Gemini key already used by shelf-copy and launch-planner —
# Vercel env vars are per-project, so it still needs to be added separately in
# this project's Vercel settings even though the key value itself can be reused.
# The app still works without a key: the "why this window" notes fall back to
# a standard template sentence.
# NEVER commit your real .env.local file or share it with anyone.
GEMINI_API_KEY=your-gemini-key-here
